==Battleground==
*24 [[Zoge]]s spawn, delay 6~20 seconds<sup>180f~600f</sup>.
*16 [[Znache]]s spawn, delay 12~20 seconds<sup>360f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*8 [[Project A]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
If you have all [[anti-Starred Alien Treasures]] from [[Cats of the Cosmos]], then you can easily rush this stage without an issue.

